"        │       └── NAME_OF_ANOTHER_CLASSICAL_REGISTER\n"
"        │           └── BitArray of count data (exists only if more than one\n"
"        |                 ClassicalRegister was specified in the circuit)\n"
"        ├── PubResult[1]\n"
"        |   ├── metadata\n"
"        |   └── data  ## In the form of a DataBin object\n"
"        |       └── NAME_OF_CLASSICAL_REGISTER\n"
"        |           └── BitArray of count data for second PUB\n"
"        ├── ...\n"
"        ├── ...\n"
"        └── ...\n"
"    ```\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Estimator output {#estimator-output}"
msgstr "Output Estimator {#estimator-output}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As stated previously, the data returned in the `PubResult` for the Estimator primitive depends on the implementation. For example, it might contain an array of expectation values (`PubResult.data.evs`) and associated standard deviations (`PubResult.data.stds`).\n"
msgstr "Seperti yang telah disebutkan sebelumnya, data yang dikembalikan dalam `PubResult` untuk primitif Estimator bergantung pada implementasinya. Misalnya, data tersebut mungkin berisi array nilai ekspektasi (`PubResult.data.evs`) dan standar deviasi terkait (`PubResult.data.stds`).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The below code snippet describes the `PrimitiveResult` (and associated `PubResult`) format for the job created above.\n"
msgstr "Potongan kode di bawah ini menjelaskan format `PrimitiveResult` (dan `PubResult` terkait) untuk job yang dibuat di atas.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sampler output {#sampler-output}"
msgstr "Output Sampler {#sampler-output}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When a Sampler job is completed successfully, the returned [`PrimitiveResult`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveResult) object contains a list of [`SamplerPubResult`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.SamplerPubResult)s, one per PUB. The data bins of these `SamplerPubResult` objects are dict-like objects that contain one `BitArray` per `ClassicalRegister` in the circuit.\n"
msgstr "Ketika job Sampler berhasil diselesaikan, objek [`PrimitiveResult`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveResult) yang dikembalikan berisi daftar [`SamplerPubResult`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.SamplerPubResult), satu per PUB. Data bin dari objek `SamplerPubResult` ini adalah objek mirip dict yang berisi satu `BitArray` per `ClassicalRegister` dalam Circuit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `BitArray` class is a container for ordered shot data. In more detail, it stores the sampled bitstrings as bytes inside a two-dimensional array. The left-most axis of this array runs over ordered shots, while the right-most axis runs over bytes.\n"
msgstr "Kelas `BitArray` adalah container untuk data shot yang terurut. Lebih detailnya, ia menyimpan bitstring yang disampling sebagai byte di dalam array dua dimensi. Sumbu paling kiri dari array ini berjalan melalui shot yang terurut, sementara sumbu paling kanan berjalan melalui byte.\n"

